     A* ======================================================================
     A* ORDDTLF - Order lines by ORDNO + LINENO
     A* Author: Arnav    Created: 2026-10-05
     A*
     A* Reads one order's lines: SETLL ORDNO, then READE until %EOF.
     A* UNIQUE enforces 'no two lines with the same LINENO on an order'.
     A*
     A* Change log:
     A*   2026-10-05  Arnav  Created (Sprint 1)
     A* ======================================================================
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A          R ORDDREC                   PFILE(ORDDTL)
     A          K ORDNO
     A          K LINENO
